 ## Background
-This method originates from research by Danny Ruijters, presented in "Optimizing GPU Volume Rendering" [S1, unofficial]. It addresses the bottlenecks in the graphics pipeline for GPU-based volume rendering, specifically focusing on data locality, cache trashing, and hardware-specific texture sampling penalties. The approach combines bricking, octree acceleration, and early ray termination to lift these bottlenecks [S1, unofficial].
